ace-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">EGT Kids<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 9 de Maio de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Estrela Grande Trail 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 11\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Estrela Grande Trail realiza-se nos dias 7, 8 e 9 de maio de 2027, no centro da vila de Manteigas (distrito da Guarda), em frente ao Edif\u00edcio da C\u00e2mara Municipal (Rua 1\u00ba de Maio), no Parque Natural da Serra da Estrela. O Uphill Frag\u00e3o do Corvo (6 km) parte em frente \u00e0 C\u00e2mara Municipal e termina no Miradouro do Frag\u00e3o do Corvo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida e tempos limite de cada prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na sexta-feira (7 de maio), o Uphill Frag\u00e3o do Corvo (6 km | 700 m D+, tempo limite 1h30) e a 1\u00aa etapa do EGT Experience partem de forma intervalada (a cada 30 segundos) entre as 18:00 e as 19:00. No s\u00e1bado (8 de maio), o Estrela Grande Trail (85 km | 4 500 m D+, tempo limite 20h00) parte \u00e0s 06:00, seguido do Estrela Orion Belt (45 km | 2 400 m D+, tempo limite 12h00) e 2\u00aa etapa do EGT Experience \u00e0s 08:30. No domingo (9 de maio), o Estrela Taurus (35 km | 1 500 m D+, tempo limite 9h00) parte \u00e0s 08:00, o Estrela Ursa Minor (15 km | 800 m D+, tempo limite 5h00), 3\u00aa etapa do EGT Experience e Caminhada Rota do Javali (15 km) partem \u00e0s 09:00, e o EGT Kids realiza-se \u00e0s 09:15.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em 3 fases: Earlybird (18 a 25 de outubro de 2026), 1\u00aa Fase (26 de outubro de 2026 a 2 de abril de 2027) e 2\u00aa Fase (3 a 18 de abril de 2027). Os pre\u00e7os s\u00e3o: Estrela Grande Trail 85 km (89 \u20ac \/ 99 \u20ac \/ 110 \u20ac), EGT Experience 65 km (65 \u20ac \/ 72 \u20ac \/ 89 \u20ac), Estrela Orion Belt 45 km (45 \u20ac \/ 50 \u20ac \/ 67 \u20ac), Estrela Taurus 35 km (30 \u20ac \/ 33 \u20ac \/ 44 \u20ac), Estrela Ursa Minor 15 km (20 \u20ac \/ 22 \u20ac \/ 33 \u20ac), Caminhada 15 km (13,50 \u20ac \/ 15 \u20ac \/ 18 \u20ac), Uphill 6 km (11 \u20ac \/ 12 \u20ac \/ 18 \u20ac) e EGT Kids (Gratuito).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de funcionamento do secretariado?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado na EGT Arena (Manteigas) funciona na sexta-feira (7 de maio) das 16:00 \u00e0s 22:00 (com prioridade entre as 16:00 e as 18:00 para o Uphill e EGT Experience), no s\u00e1bado (8 de maio) das 05:00 \u00e0s 08:00 e das 17:00 \u00e0s 20:00, e no domingo (9 de maio) das 06:30 \u00e0s 09:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que material obrigat\u00f3rio \u00e9 exigido aos participantes?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os participantes (incluindo Caminhada e Uphill) t\u00eam de transportar o Kit B\u00e1sico de Seguran\u00e7a (manta t\u00e9rmica >= 1,40&#215;2 m, apito e telem\u00f3vel operacional) e copo reutiliz\u00e1vel (>= 125 ml, j\u00e1 que a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o disponibiliza copos descart\u00e1veis). Nas dist\u00e2ncias superiores acrescem casaco imperme\u00e1vel com capuz (>= 10 000 Schmerber), reserva de \u00e1gua (0,5 L a 1,5 L), ligadura el\u00e1stica, recipiente para comida quente (bowl nos 85 km e 45 km), frontal com bateria de reserva e camisola t\u00e9rmica (nos 85 km), podendo a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o ativar o Kit Frio ou Kit Calor at\u00e9 24h antes da prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Estrela Grande Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-05-07\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Manteigas, Guarda\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Manteigas\", \"addressRegion\": \"Guarda\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Estrela Outdoor Events\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Estrela Grande Trail 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 11\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Estrela Grande Trail realiza-se nos dias 7, 8 e 9 de maio de 2027, no centro da vila de Manteigas (distrito da Guarda), em frente ao Edif\u00edcio da C\u00e2mara Municipal (Rua 1\u00ba de Maio), no Parque Natural da Serra da Estrela. O Uphill Frag\u00e3o do Corvo (6 km) parte em frente \u00e0 C\u00e2mara Municipal e termina no Miradouro do Frag\u00e3o do Corvo.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Q