6:00 e as 18:00 para o Uphill e EGT Experience), no s\u00e1bado (8 de maio) das 05:00 \u00e0s 08:00 e das 17:00 \u00e0s 20:00, e no domingo (9 de maio) das 06:30 \u00e0s 09:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que material obrigat\u00f3rio \u00e9 exigido aos participantes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todos os participantes (incluindo Caminhada e Uphill) t\u00eam de transportar o Kit B\u00e1sico de Seguran\u00e7a (manta t\u00e9rmica >= 1,40x2 m, apito e telem\u00f3vel operacional) e copo reutiliz\u00e1vel (>= 125 ml, j\u00e1 que a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o disponibiliza copos descart\u00e1veis). Nas dist\u00e2ncias superiores acrescem casaco imperme\u00e1vel com capuz (>= 10 000 Schmerber), reserva de \u00e1gua (0,5 L a 1,5 L), ligadura el\u00e1stica, recipiente para comida quente (bowl nos 85 km e 45 km), frontal com bateria de reserva e camisola t\u00e9rmica (nos 85 km), podendo a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o ativar o Kit Frio ou Kit Calor at\u00e9 24h antes da prova.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70147,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,624,22,497,498,499],"event_type_2":[212,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-70146","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-manteigas-guarda","event_type-caminhada","event_type-kids","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-guarda","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-estrela-grande-trail.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/70146","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"c